
-------------------------------------------------------------------

NESTJS/TYPESCRIPT SPECIFIC IGNORES

-------------------------------------------------------------------

TypeScript compilation output (where your compiled JavaScript lives)

/dist
/build
/out

Testing and Coverage results

/coverage

NestJS CLI cache folder

/.nestjs-cli-cache

-------------------------------------------------------------------

CRITICAL SECURITY FILES: ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES

NEVER commit files containing secrets or credentials.

-------------------------------------------------------------------

.env
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test
.env.local
.env.*.local
.vault.json

-------------------------------------------------------------------

NODE MODULES AND PACKAGE MANAGER FILES

-------------------------------------------------------------------

/node_modules
/npm-debug.log*
/yarn-error.log*
/pnpm-debug.log*

-------------------------------------------------------------------

EDITOR AND OPERATING SYSTEM FILES

-------------------------------------------------------------------

Visual Studio Code

.vscode/

JetBrains IDEs (IntelliJ, WebStorm, etc.)

.idea/

Operating System Files

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

Misc temporary files

*.log
*.tmp